# ---- 13 readers: prices fell; merchants, lawyers, craftsmen read; everyday languages; schools --------------------
shot readers at 0,-33
ent folk    dots 40 grid 10 shape user color soft at -3.8,1.4
ent who     list "merchants" "lawyers" "craftsmen" size 0.3 at -3.8,-1.7
ent price   meter 9 "price of a book" max 10 h 2.6 at 0.4,0.6
ent lat     tag "latin" size 0.4 fill ink color white at 4.2,2.6
ent langs   list "german" "french" "english" "italian" size 0.28 at 4.2,0.4
ent school  icon school badge navy size 1.0 at 3.5,-2.4
ent gram    icon book-open badge gold size 1.0 at 5.0,-2.4

