w519        in lat pop
w525-w528   in langs stagger .2
w526        strike lat
w529        in school pop
w539        in gram pop
w540        connect school gram

# ---- 14 luther: 1517, Wittenberg; printed within days, read across Germany within weeks ------------------------
shot luther at 18,-33
