ent gm      map "5,46.5,16,55" year 1500 w 5.4 h 5.6 at 4.2,0.0
ent wit     pin Wittenberg on gm side down
ent hre     region "Holy Roman Empire" on gm color coral opacity 0.35
ent fast    tag "within weeks" size 0.34 at 4.2,3.3

